  "components": {
    "customize": [
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "Tutorial",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/07/06/237301566/4d581a19baf5823acf774aa095eda43d_5866158806238870608.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "Open your Inventory and equip Sandrone's Portable Tea Table in the Gadget menu. Then, press the <color=#ffe04b>Tea Party Notes</color> button to start a Tea Party.\nNote: For the best experience, <color=#ffe04b>it is recommended that you complete</color> Archon Quest"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 10840,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 28
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "as well as"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 11193,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 32
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "before unlocking the Tea Party storyline."
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/07/06/237301566/d49834346b9d203185fef2d955f8e697_7528498686719786186.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "In the Tea Party Notes screen, you can select the character you wish to invite to your Tea Party and send them an invitation."
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/07/06/237301566/c26f7b04bacdb181a96295d05fb42c52_2747840828156804575.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "After sending an invitation to a character, follow the prompts and head to a suitable location. Then, simply place the gadget \"Sandrone's Portable Tea Table\" and have Sandrone take her seat to start the Tea Party."
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/07/06/237301566/4de4f6389e1faea0f532dfbe3c957212_8982821967273457686.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffe04b>Find the location that fits the quest description</color> inside the yellow circle indicated to place the tea table and have Sandrone take her seat to start the Tea Party. You can revisit completed Tea Parties in \"Tea Party Notes.\""
      },
